  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">需要&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheotic-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheotic Additions</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-reforging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ancient Reforging</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本Mod添加了异界锻造台，可使用Apotheotic Additions的额外稀有度（Artifact、Heirloom、Esoteric）进行锻造。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本Mod添加了异界锻造台，可使用Apotheotic Additions的额外稀有度（Artifact、Heirloom、Esoteric）进行锻造。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\">未包含异界锻造台的合成配方。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\">未包含异界锻造台的合成配方。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d7cbcda-9e63-469f-b9d6-d39dd2341bcc.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>异界锻造台与Apotheosis的锻造台类似，可以为物品赋予最高至Esoteric稀有度的词缀。</p>\n<p>会消耗Apotheotic Additions的稀有度材料。</p>\n<p>异界锻造台与Apotheosis的锻造台类似，可以为物品赋予最高至Esoteric稀有度的词缀。</p>\n<p>会消耗Apotheotic Additions的稀有度材料。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bad90522-7548-4c39-8ccf-d7486d05ba98.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>致谢：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadows_of_fire/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadows_of_Fire</a> 提供 Apotheosis</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ianm1647/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ianm1647</a> 提供 Ancient Reforging</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/bryce792/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">bryce792</a> 提供 Apotheotic Additions</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
